\ulnone\cf2  Production and  Construction Corps. Through a cultural center construction plan,  this subsidy from the government will be used as part of the  investment to construct 23,400 comprehensive cultural centers in  villages and townships. The state has provided financial aid to  renew a large amount of broadcasting and film dubbing equipment  for minority languages, has set up 10 minority-language film  dubbing centers in Inner Mongolia, Tibet, and }
